{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10189","headline":"故吏部郎中赠给事中韦公挽歌二首 二 · 李嘉佑","name":"故吏部郎中赠给事中韦公挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"社里东城接，松阡北地开。\n闻笳春色惨，执绋故人哀。\n终日南山对，何时渭水回。\n仁兄与恩旧，相望泣泉台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}